Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:52.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.01,0:01:57.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That thing? Are you sure you\Nwant to bring it along?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.52,0:02:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI]\NUh, so... you don't\Nthink I'll need it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.19,0:02:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not certain\Nyou'll be able to use it
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.40,0:02:06.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.\NDo as you please.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh. Thanks for\Nletting me bring it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.65,0:02:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just really like this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI whimpers]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.95,0:02:31.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NDo you mourn them?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.83,0:02:34.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]\NUh, no, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.12,0:02:37.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. You don't have to put on\Nsuch a formal act, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.88,0:02:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Express yourself, but don't make\Nthe same mistakes as those fools
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.52,0:02:44.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who couldn't comprehend\Nthe true power of God.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.90,0:02:47.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They took me too lightly and\Nso forfeited their lives
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.40,0:02:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the process. Their failure\Nwas that their minds were not
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.86,0:02:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,controlled by fear,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.41,0:02:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and so they were not\Nprepared for battle with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.89,0:02:56.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.27,0:02:58.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYes. I-I suppose so.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.58,0:03:07.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI can't let him onto my plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.86,0:03:11.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to\Nobey everything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An opportunity for escape will\Npresent itself at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:18.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhere is he taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.59,0:03:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NWhat do you think?\NAmazing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.59,0:03:50.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only ship of\Nits kind in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.14,0:03:53.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it can only be\Ncontrolled by me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's powered\Npurely by lightning.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NIs that even possible?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.56,0:04:03.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I assure you it is possible.\NI channel my abundant energy
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.44,0:04:05.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,through a material that\Ncan handle the power
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and automatically transmit\Nit throughout the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.57,0:04:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What material could possibly\Nwithstand that much power?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.33,0:04:18.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.25,0:04:21.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The gold I have harvested from\Nthis island works perfectly.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.75,0:04:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure it will make many\Ninhabitants of this island
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.88,0:04:28.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,happy to see a flying ship\Nbefore their demise.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.30,0:04:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sight of this\Nmagnificent ship in flight
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will be the last thing they see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NA flying ship?\NI don't believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.62,0:04:40.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If it really flies,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.08,0:04:43.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I might not have a chance\Nfor escape after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Behold the Ark Maxim.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.95,0:04:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With this ship we will reach the\Nland that knows no boundary.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will travel to the\NEndless Vearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA, LUFFY, PIERRE scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NWe're outside.\NWe finally escaped.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.13,0:05:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ground is made\Nof stone. Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:57.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA grunts]\NWhat going on, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:14.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:22.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo! Where are we?\NWhat are these old buildings?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.95,0:06:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like this could be the\Nplace that huge golden bell
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:32.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this place? Wait.\NCould this be our homeland?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.17,0:06:35.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But where'd that\Nbig hole come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.72,0:06:42.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NLuffy! Wait!\NWhere are you going this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.89,0:06:47.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NWait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]\NHey, Zoro!\NWhat's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.57,0:06:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.27,0:06:55.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could this have\Nhappened to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.57,0:06:59.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could any of this have\Nhappened with you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNami! Where's Nami?\NShe's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:12.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper...! Wyper, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper...! Wyper, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:19.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bazooka guy was really strong.\NBut even he fell in this fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who could possibly\Nhave done all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was Eneru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:32.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NHe's the only one who\Ncould do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:35.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:39.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru, huh? That God guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.78,0:07:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.03,0:07:43.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Mantra didn't work\Nat all the whole time
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we were in the snake.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I don't know\Nwhat happened here.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.58,0:07:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I do know that it was\NEneru who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:59.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our Navigator.\NShe went with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:02.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NJust hang in there.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.13,0:08:06.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're saying Nami\Nwas taken away from here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:09.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by that God guy? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:09.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:15.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully. If we\Ndon't do something, Skypiea...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...will disappear.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? It'll disappear?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.67,0:08:24.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NMy homeland will\Nbe completely gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.43,0:08:27.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything will fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.27,0:08:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He said this nation in\Nthe sky was unnatural.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.23,0:08:34.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He said he'd send it\Ncrashing to the ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.42,0:08:45.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NEneru is definitely\Ngoing after the golden bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.86,0:08:49.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won't destroy this\Nplace until he's found it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, and you have to stop him.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.78,0:08:55.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you must hurry because\Nthere isn't much time left.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't let Eneru\Nfind that bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:00.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NDon't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.33,0:09:01.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know where they are.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.99,0:09:05.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are only two voices\Nleft on this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.37,0:09:08.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It has to be Nami and Eneru.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAisa.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.92,0:09:19.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need you to take me\Nto them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:26.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NThere it is, Angel Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.18,0:09:34.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The arch criminals Pagaya\Nand his daughter Conis,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.79,0:09:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,along with their accomplice,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.19,0:09:39.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the former God Gan Fall,\Nare still on the loose!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.69,0:09:41.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please be on your guard!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.82,0:09:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NIf anyone sees these fugitives,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.94,0:09:47.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,please alert me,\NMcKinley, immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.91,0:09:50.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Again, report any\Nnews directly to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.95,0:09:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the name of the great God\NEneru, we of the White Berets,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.83,0:09:58.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will defend the security of\NSkypiea with our very lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Heso!\N– Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.80,0:10:02.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET D]\NCaptain! I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.50,0:10:04.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? You say that\NPagaya's daughter
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has just been seen\Nin the harbor?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.94,0:10:29.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET E]\NThe heretic has\Nentered through gate number one!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.55,0:10:30.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NI don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.97,0:10:33.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd she come back when\Nshe knows she'll be caught?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.76,0:10:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NDon't let her get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Capture her at all costs!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.95,0:10:40.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Come on, criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:46.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:51.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERETS shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NMove it! Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:04.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Captain!\N– Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Captain!\N– Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.74,0:11:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:17.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD shouting]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.34,0:11:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MALE A]\NCaptain Mckinley!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.63,0:11:27.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MALE B]\NIt's the criminal!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.67,0:11:28.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MALE C]\NStay away!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.84,0:11:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MALE D]\NJudgment will fall on her!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLook at all that gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.98,0:11:44.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NRemember your girl\Nfriend from Angel Island?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been listening and it\Nsounds like she's causing
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,an uproar among\Nthe citizens.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis? No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She should be waiting on\Nthe Going Merry right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.91,0:11:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThere's a great deal of\Nnoise outside at the moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.08,0:11:59.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But no matter. It's hardly\Nworth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:02.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:03.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.82,0:12:06.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUh, about this Mantra\Nability that all of you
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.99,0:12:09.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seem to possess.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you use it to locate\Na specific individual?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.12,0:12:15.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not usually. Most of\Nus lack that ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:18.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, I can. I am unique.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In addition to my\NMantra abilities,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.14,0:12:24.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my lightning powers allow me\Nto pick up electrical vibrations
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and overhear conversations.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.73,0:12:29.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I hear someone\Nsay something, shall we say,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.65,0:12:33.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"out of line," I cast\Nmy Judgment on them.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.53,0:12:36.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The range of my hearing extends\Nover this entire land.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSo that's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.00,0:12:40.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NIt's a suitable talent\Nfor a god, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]\NRun as fast as you can,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.41,0:12:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,people of the sky!\NThis is Skypiea's last dance!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.16,0:12:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A party of angels\Ndancing in the sky! Haha!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You! Have you ever seen the\Nlook on a mortal's face
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.59,0:12:58.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when he suddenly\Nloses his footing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHe's out of his mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What should I do? I have to\Nget away from here, or else.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.30,0:13:09.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Even if I get away,\Nhe'll destroy the sky island.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.84,0:13:13.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something\NI can do, but what?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.47,0:13:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NI... I-Is there\Nsomething wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NWho is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:27.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NNo, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.61,0:13:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NPlease! You must listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Get back, stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:40.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone. You have to listen\Nto me! Please calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.12,0:13:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to waste!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.69,0:13:43.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must hear what\NI have to say!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.27,0:13:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get away from us, criminal!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.15,0:13:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave this island,\Nyou pestilence!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.44,0:13:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! You must leave now\Nor we'll all be destroyed
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.99,0:13:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when the Judgment\Nstrikes you down!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.45,0:13:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You heretic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET I grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NDon't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a Burn Bazooka.\NI'll use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:10.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.34,0:14:14.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! You have\Nto go to Cloud End
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.80,0:14:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at the edge of the clouds\Nright away before it's too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to escape\Nto the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This land is about\Nto be destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.63,0:14:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:28.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Use every ship you can find and\Nleave Angel Island at once!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of lunacy is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.89,0:14:36.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru's planning to destroy\Nthis land and everyone on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.27,0:14:39.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't evacuate now,\Nwe're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! You're crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kinda trick is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this revenge?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's nothing to be\Njoking about, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN J]\NYou think we're idiots?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.27,0:14:51.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LITTLE BOY]\NDon't talk\Nthat way about Eneru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:52.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NOh, sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[inhales]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.26,0:15:16.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(705,1053)}– Now! Arrest her!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:18.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.89,0:15:23.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept\Nthat Eneru is God!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.41,0:15:31.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NFather...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:37.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN K]\NShe must be insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.61,0:16:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's strange,\Nthe Judgment didn't come.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.32,0:16:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN F]\NBut, why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN M]\NAnd after\Ncommitting such sacrilege
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.37,0:16:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,against God,\NI don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD chatters]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.78,0:16:13.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NIt's because\Nthere's no longer any point
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in taking one life alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.49,0:16:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Skypiea is doomed." It's true.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.62,0:16:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A member of the Divine Squad\Nescaped from Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He risked his life to\Ndeliver that message.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:29.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He died with my father when\NEneru cast judgment on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did God do that? But why?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.11,0:16:38.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought he was supposed\Nto take care of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.00,0:16:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What does that lady mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NThere's no time left.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.74,0:16:46.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the edge\Nof the clouds at once!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.49,0:16:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To Cloud End!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.22,0:16:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN M]\NWait just a minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.82,0:16:53.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't do it! We can't\Njust up and go like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.45,0:16:55.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were all born and\Nraised here in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.66,0:16:56.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't live anywhere else!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN N]\NYeah, she's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.61,0:17:01.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,None of us have ever even\Nvisited the Blue Sea before!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.32,0:17:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How would we be able\Nto live there? Besides...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.49,0:17:04.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then are you going\Nto stay here,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doing nothing, waiting to die?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've all known for the past\Nsix years what kind of a man
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru is! Has he ever\Nshown mercy? Compassion?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.67,0:17:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he says he's going to do\Nthis, then you know he will!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not that bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.37,0:17:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe a miracle will\Nhappen or something,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and our island will be spared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why not?\NMaybe he'll change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:28.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. That could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD gasps, screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.41,0:17:50.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NIf we know anything\Nabout Eneru, we know this.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.87,0:17:53.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's always had the power\Nto bring us to despair,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to make us suffer\Nand break us!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.23,0:17:57.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I tell you, what happens\Nnow will make our past
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,suffering insignificant!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.19,0:18:01.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not going to do\Nany good sitting
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and waiting for a miracle!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.83,0:18:05.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to face the fact\Nthat as far as this land
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.29,0:18:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is concerned,\NGod has abandoned us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before we pray.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.05,0:18:11.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before we close our eyes to\Nwhat's really happening here,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.22,0:18:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we have to do what we\Ncan to save ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't survive by hiding\Nbehind his victims any longer!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.75,0:18:20.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we do nothing, no matter\Nwho we try to blame,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:24.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we're all going to lose our\Nlives and it'll be our fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.22,0:18:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NNow. If we want\Nto live, we must leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:36.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD yelling, shouting]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN DD]\NOh, miss.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.53,0:18:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what\Nhappened to the Divine Squad?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.57,0:18:47.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My husband is one of them
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I can't leave\Nthe island without him!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.11,0:18:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And my son's a member!\NIs he okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.16,0:18:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in six years!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, too. My only son\Nis with them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.53,0:19:00.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NThe Divine Squad\Nmay already be...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN E]\NWhat have they\Nbeen doing all this time
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on the Upper Yard?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.45,0:19:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN DD]\NAre they still there?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.66,0:19:08.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell us anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.33,0:19:12.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please calm yourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.82,0:19:15.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assure you the White Berets\Nwill look into this matter!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.52,0:19:16.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will find your\Nfamily members
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.94,0:19:19.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and make sure they're\Nescorted safely to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.32,0:19:21.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now hurry! You must escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN EE]\NBut Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NMove along!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain, why?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.53,0:19:29.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NI can guess what will\Nhappen to the Divine Squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:30.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NEneru is that kind of man.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.91,0:19:34.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've always known that.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.66,0:19:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But right now, our priority\Nis to make sure the citizens
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are evacuated as\Nquickly as possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let this\Nend like Birka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:42.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Birka?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was Eneru's homeland.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.66,0:19:47.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A sky island to the far\Nsoutheast of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.75,0:19:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been told it\Ndisappeared without a trace
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.71,0:19:51.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,some six years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. Six years ago?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.96,0:19:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NThat's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru destroyed his own\Nhomeland, and then came here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.81,0:20:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Birka was home to many\Nstrong warriors,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.69,0:20:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but they were helpless\Nbefore Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An invincible God.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.77,0:20:11.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know,\Nmaybe he really is.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You might already know this,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.82,0:20:16.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but we White Berets were\Nonce in the Divine Squad,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,pledged to the service\Nof Lord Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.76,0:20:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We thought that if we pretended\Nto betray the Divine Squad
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and swore our allegiance\Nto Lord Eneru,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.23,0:20:24.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we could stay on the island
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.43,0:20:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and find some way to\Nprotect the citizens.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.14,0:20:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, now it's all too clear\Nthat plan was a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:35.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We tried to keep anyone from\Nprovoking Eneru's anger.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.55,0:20:38.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We hoped that if no one\Ndisobeyed him, they'd be safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What else could we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For nothing! For nothing!\NFor nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NIt wasn't for nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.11,0:20:54.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NAfter all this time,\NI finally understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.03,0:20:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NCaptain?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.73,0:20:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can... Can I count on you\Nto handle things here?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.61,0:21:01.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, but where are\Nyou going? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well you see,\Nthere are some people
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who don't know how to escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.66,0:21:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some friends of mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.37,0:21:08.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to go back.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[footsteps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.25,0:21:14.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NOf course!\NThe Blue Sea dwellers!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.37,0:21:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Heso!\N– Heso!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:19.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.42,0:21:20.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY pants]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY shouts]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[pants, grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.67,0:21:45.22,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI won't be able to\Nmove them all at once.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.60,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We've at least got to\Nreach the upper level.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.68,0:21:52.02,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Somehow, we must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAisa!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.72,0:22:04.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're sure it's this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:08.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! We're almost there!\NI'm sure this is the right way!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.12,0:22:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGood!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NThat's it, Luffy!\NThat hole to your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:17.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there! That's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.16,0:22:18.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then that's where we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.96,0:22:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NAs I thought,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.46,0:22:33.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they weren't among\Nthe five survivors.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.33,0:22:37.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now where in the world could\Nthey have been hiding?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.46,0:22:38.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How aggravating!\NThere's nothing I hate more
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than when my predictions\Nturn out wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.11,0:22:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[inhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:58.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey! Are you the\None they call Eneru?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:03.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cheers]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.74,0:23:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you mess with friends\Nof mine, then you mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:21.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NHmph... Those fools\Nwere your friends?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.33,0:23:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou stay right there!\NI'm coming up to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.38,0:23:26.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NMind your tongue, mortal!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.38,0:23:28.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're speaking to God!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.13,0:23:30.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat makes you God anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.72,0:23:34.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NHe's deliberately\Npicking a fight with Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.15,0:23:35.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE whines]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Luffy! Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:44.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.59,0:23:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI can hear it now,\Nthe angels' party!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.58,0:23:50.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The citizens must have\Nlearned of Skypiea's fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.66,0:23:52.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.26,0:23:54.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI wonder how far they\Ncan run before the ground
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.42,0:23:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,gives out beneath them!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.25,0:24:01.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI said, what makes\Nyou God anyway?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.30,0:24:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:05.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.64,0:24:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NAh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.31,0:24:14.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are no ordinary human, but\Nyou're a mere Paramecia type.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.02,0:24:17.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't beat me.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.15,0:24:22.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NNothing that lives\Ncan stand against me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.53,0:24:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why... I am God!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.74,0:24:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}[ENERU]\NEl...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Thor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.24,0:24:34.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.66,0:24:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI shouts]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.48,0:25:00.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.71,0:25:05.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that you\Nmanaged to dodge it.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sixty Million Volts!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.77,0:25:09.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHe dodged it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.69,0:25:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ENERU]\NJulungul!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.95,0:25:15.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.16,0:25:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.29,0:25:27.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One hundred million volt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.71,0:25:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Vari!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.26,0:25:33.39,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOf course!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.59,0:25:36.30,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'd thought about it,\NI would've realized it sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lightning can't hurt Luffy,\Nhe's made of rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.22,0:25:44.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.36,0:25:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.95,0:26:00.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.52,0:26:01.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NStay calm!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.95,0:26:04.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Physical attacks still\Ncan't affect my body!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.53,0:26:07.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's just a helpless monkey\Nfrom the Blue Sea World.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.46,0:26:09.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.12,0:26:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.84,0:26:15.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHis electrical powers\Nare completely useless!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.84,0:26:18.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru must never have imagined\Nthere was someone in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.92,0:26:23.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who was immune to lightning!\NIt's incredible, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.05,0:26:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU grunts, groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.77,0:26:32.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy may be the\Nonly person in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.73,0:26:37.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who can battle Eneru.\NThey're natural enemies!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
